# SQL 안전장치만 기존 실행 이미지에 추가하는 검토용 후보. 아직 빌드·배포하지 않았다.
# BASE_IMAGE는 snapshot이 만든 전용 recovery_tag를 사용하고 해당 ID를 먼저 확인한다.
ARG BASE_IMAGE
FROM ${BASE_IMAGE}
RUN python -m pip install --no-cache-dir pglast==7.20
COPY app/infrastructure/db/migrate.py /srv/app/infrastructure/db/migrate.py
COPY app/infrastructure/db/migration_plan.py /srv/app/infrastructure/db/migration_plan.py
COPY app/infrastructure/db/migration_sql.py /srv/app/infrastructure/db/migration_sql.py
COPY app/infrastructure/db/migrations/migration-plan.json /srv/app/infrastructure/db/migrations/migration-plan.json
RUN python -m app.infrastructure.db.migrate --check > /srv/migration-safety.json
